@startuml HostInference
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' purpose: how a local model reaches an sbx agent — the host's Ollama on the host GPU, one port across the VM boundary
' covers: internal/sbx/host_ollama.go
' covers: internal/sbx/host_ollama_test.go
' covers: internal/run/model_row.go (bakedModels.host, hostModelFor)
' covers: internal/run/run.go (promptChoices, selectBackend, applyModelImage)
' covers: internal/egress/plan.go (LocalModelEnv)
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/sandbox.go (Spec allow, proxyOnlyVar)
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/host_inference_test.go
'   the measurements and rejected options ... _spec/_experiments/sbx-host-inference.puml
'   the model row ............................ _spec/defs/hermes/hermes-paradigm.puml
'
' ── RULE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' On sbx, ANY local model — `--local-model X` or a model-row choice — is served by
' the operator's own Ollama on the host, never inside the VM and never by a server
' proveo starts. The microVM has no GPU on macOS and a passthrough-only GPU on Linux.
' proveo checks and routes; it does not install, start, pull or tune Ollama.
'
' ── SEQUENCE (selectBackend, sbx branch, before the sandbox exists) ─────────
'   1. GET 127.0.0.1:11434/api/tags. No answer ⇒ refuse with the install URL.
'   2. Tag lookup: exact, or bare name ⇒ ":latest" (Ollama's rule). Missing ⇒
'      refuse with `ollama pull <tag>` and the installed tags of the same repo.
'   3. Already in /api/ps ⇒ resident, no new memory, done.
'   4. Fit: need = size + size/8 + 1 GiB against reclaimable memory
'      (macOS vm_stat free+inactive+speculative+purgeable; Linux MemAvailable).
'      need > available ⇒ refuse unless PROVEO_LOCAL_MODEL_FORCE=1. No reading
'      (windows, freebsd) ⇒ pass.
'   5. agent env = egress.LocalModelEnv(tag, http://host.docker.internal:11434)
'      + SBX_CRED_ANTHROPIC_MODE=none + SBX_CRED_OPENAI_MODE=none, the pair sbx's
'      own --model mixin sets so proxy-held auth cannot outrank the local route.
'   6. Kit network.allow += localhost:11434 — the sbx proxy matches
'      host.docker.internal:<port> as localhost:<port>. Measured: /api/tags and
'      /v1/models both 200 from a guest against Ollama bound to 127.0.0.1.
'   The sidecar plan gets LocalModel="" so no Ollama container is planned.
'
' ── WHY NOT llmman (removed 2026-09-26) ────────────────────────────────────
' sbx bundles llmman, and it served qwen3.8:27b on Metal. It also froze a 48 GB
' M4 Pro: llama-server reserved the model's full 262k context across 4 unified
' slots (n_ctx_slot=262144, n_slots=4), reached 34 GB RSS and filled 21.5 GB of
' swap during hermes's ~14.6k-token first prompt. `llmman serve` exposes no
' context or slot flag. The operator's Ollama had OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH=131072
' and a VRAM-based default (num_ctx 32768 at 37.4 GiB), i.e. already tuned.
'
' ── MODEL ROW MAPPING ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
'   Muse Glimmer 30B → muse-glimmer:30b-q4_K_M   (the tag the baked image pulls)
'   Qwen 3.8 27B     → qwen3.8:27b-q4_K_M
' The row resolves to the host route when sandbox.Selected predicts sbx. If sbx
' then turns out unavailable, selectBackend restores the baked image and clears
' LocalModel, so the docker path keeps its own sidecar/baked behaviour.
'
' ── NO_PROXY IS A PROXY VARIABLE ───────────────────────────────────────────
' The plan's NO_PROXY (localhost,…,ollama,host.docker.internal) used to cross
' into the sandbox and replace sbx's own, which lists gateway.docker.internal.
' proxyOnlyVar now drops NO_PROXY / no_proxy with the other proxy variables.

actor "Operator" as OP
node "host" as HOST {
  component "proveo run" as RUN
  component "Ollama (operator's)\n127.0.0.1:11434" as OLL
}
node "sbx microVM" as VM {
  component "hermes\nconfig.yaml ← entrypoint.sh" as AG
}

OP --> RUN : model row / --local-model
RUN --> OLL : tags · ps · fit check
RUN --> VM : Kit allow localhost:11434\nenv OLLAMA_API_BASE
AG --> OLL : host.docker.internal:11434/v1

note right of OLL
  **Check, never manage.** proveo refuses
  a missing server, a missing tag, or a
  model that would swap; it does not
  start, pull or configure Ollama.
end note

note right of AG
  **hermes ignores *_BASE_URL.** It reads
  model.base_url from config.yaml, which
  wire_hermes_local_endpoint writes from
  OLLAMA_API_BASE + PROVEO_LOCAL_MODEL.
end note
@enduml
